      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고스트타입 포켓몬의 약점은\n고스트타입과 악타입...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n이게 무슨 뜻인지 아시겠나요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0C2A4D2B8D0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAACC7580020C57DC810C740000AACE0C2A4D2B8D0C0C785ACFC0020C545D0C0C785002E002E002E00100001BE00000AC774AC8C0020BB34C2A80020B73BC778C9C00020C544C2DCACA0B098C694003F00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B1240000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 2
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아니요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544B2C8C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고스트타입끼리의 승부에서는\n스피드가 승패를 좌우한다는 말이에요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0C2A4D2B8D0C0C785B07CB9ACC7580020C2B9BD80C5D0C11CB294000AC2A4D53CB4DCAC000020C2B9D328B97C0020C88CC6B0D55CB2E4B2940020B9D0C774C5D0C694002E002E002E00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨,\n누가 더 고스트타입을 능숙하게 다루는지<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n승부해 보지 않으시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020C528002C000AB204AC000020B3540020ACE0C2A4D2B8D0C0C785C7440020B2A5C219D558AC8C0020B2E4B8E8B294C9C000100001BE00000AC2B9BD80D5740020BCF4C9C00020C54AC73CC2DCACA0C5B4C694003F00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고스트타입을 가진 포켓몬으로 준비해서\n제게 말을 걸어 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0C2A4D2B8D0C0C785C7440020AC00C9C40020D3ECCF13BAACC73CB85C0020C900BE44D574C11C000AC81CAC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
