      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부는 고스트타입을 가진 포켓몬만으로\n부탁드려요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80B2940020ACE0C2A4D2B8D0C0C785C7440020AC00C9C40020D3ECCF13BAACB9CCC73CB85C000ABD80D0C1B4DCB824C694002E00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "누가 더 고스트타입을 능숙하게 다루는지\n승부해 보지 않으시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B204AC000020B3540020ACE0C2A4D2B8D0C0C785C7440020B2A5C219D558AC8C0020B2E4B8E8B294C9C0000AC2B9BD80D5740020BCF4C9C00020C54AC73CC2DCACA0C5B4C694003F00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋아요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC544C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사양할게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC591D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네? 고스트타입 포켓몬만 데리고 있으면서\n승부해 주지 않으시는 건가요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124003F0020ACE0C2A4D2B8D0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAACB9CC0020B370B9ACACE00020C788C73CBA74C11C000AC2B9BD80D5740020C8FCC9C00020C54AC73CC2DCB2940020AC74AC00C694003F00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스피드에서 지더라도\n만회할 방법을 준비해 뒀다구요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4D53CB4DCC5D0C11C0020C9C0B354B77CB3C4000AB9CCD68CD5600020BC29BC95C7440020C900BE44D5740020B480B2E4AD6CC694002100100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제가 졌네요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CAC000020C84CB124C694002E002E002E00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스피드에서 졌을 경우의 대비책으로\n저주의부적을 지니게 해서<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n고스트타입 기술의 위력을 올렸는데...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4D53CB4DCC5D0C11C0020C84CC7440020ACBDC6B0C7580020B300BE44CC45C73CB85C000AC800C8FCC758BD80C801C7440020C9C0B2C8AC8C0020D574C11C00100001BE00000AACE0C2A4D2B8D0C0C7850020AE30C220C7580020C704B825C7440020C62CB838B294B370002E002E002E00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "역시 시로 님과 무쿠 님을 화해시킨\n뛰어난 트레이너는 뭔가 다르네요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5EDC2DC0020C2DCB85C0020B2D8ACFC0020BB34CFE00020B2D8C7440020D654D574C2DCD0A8000AB6F0C5B4B09C0020D2B8B808C774B108B2940020BB54AC000020B2E4B974B124C694002E002E002E00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "헉!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D5C9002100100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "방금 한기가 느껴지지 않았나요...?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC29AE080020D55CAE30AC000020B290AEF4C9C0C9C00020C54AC558B098C694002E002E002E003F00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "모르겠는데요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAA8B974ACA0B294B370C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "느껴지지 않으세요?\n이 오싹하고 음침한 느낌...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n설마, 무쿠 님의 샹델라가\n조금 전의 발언에 화가 나서 제 영혼을...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "벌받는 건 싫어요!\n아까는 잘못 말한 거예요!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n영혼을 빨아들이는 건 참아 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC8CBC1BB2940020AC740020C2EBC5B4C6940021000AC544AE4CB2940020C798BABB0020B9D0D55C0020AC70C608C694002100100001BE00000AC601D63CC7440020BE68C544B4E4C774B2940020AC740020CC38C5440020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "헉!\n오싹한 느낌이 사라졌어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D5C90021000AC624C2F9D55C0020B290B08CC7740020C0ACB77CC84CC5B4C694002E00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "무쿠 님이 안 계신 곳에서도\n시로 님 이야기는 금기였나 보네요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB34CFE00020B2D8C7740020C5480020ACC4C2E00020ACF3C5D0C11CB3C4000AC2DCB85C0020B2D80020C774C57CAE30B2940020AE08AE30C600B0980020BCF4B124C694002E002E002E00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬에게 지니게 하면\n고스트타입 기술의 위력이 오르는<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n저주의부적을 드릴 테니 받아 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
